{
  "schemaVersion": "0.2.0",
  "book": "PSA",
  "psalm": 1,
  "sourceVersion": "UHB v2.1.32",
  "psalmStatus": "in-progress",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.1.L1",
      "verse": "1",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-1-1",
        "h-1-1-2",
        "h-1-1-3",
        "h-1-1-4",
        "h-1-1-5",
        "h-1-1-6",
        "h-1-1-7"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-1-1",
        "t-1-1-2",
        "t-1-1-3",
        "t-1-1-4",
        "t-1-1-5"
      ],
      "tamilText": "பாக்கியமான மனிதன், துன்மார்க்கர்களுடைய ஆலோசனையின்படி நடக்காமலும்,",
      "englishText": "Blessed is the man who walks not in the counsel of the wicked,",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.1.L2",
      "verse": "1",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-1-8",
        "h-1-1-9",
        "h-1-1-10",
        "h-1-1-11"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-1-6",
        "t-1-1-7",
        "t-1-1-8"
      ],
      "tamilText": "பாவிகளுடைய வழியில் நிற்காமலும்,",
      "englishText": "nor stands in the way of sinners,",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.1.L3",
      "verse": "1",
      "lineIndex": 3,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-1-12",
        "h-1-1-13",
        "h-1-1-14",
        "h-1-1-15"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-1-9",
        "t-1-1-10",
        "t-1-1-11",
        "t-1-1-12"
      ],
      "tamilText": "பரியாசக்காரர்கள் உட்காரும் இடத்தில் உட்காராமலும்,",
      "englishText": "nor sits in the seat of scoffers;",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.2.L1",
      "verse": "2",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-2-3",
        "h-1-2-4",
        "h-1-2-5"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-2-1",
        "t-1-2-2",
        "t-1-2-3",
        "t-1-2-4"
      ],
      "tamilText": "யெகோவாவின் வேதத்தில் பிரியமாக இருந்து,",
      "englishText": "but his delight is in the law of the Lord,",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.2.L2",
      "verse": "2",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-2-6",
        "h-1-2-7",
        "h-1-2-8",
        "h-1-2-9"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-2-5",
        "t-1-2-6",
        "t-1-2-7",
        "t-1-2-8",
        "t-1-2-9",
        "t-1-2-10"
      ],
      "tamilText": "இரவும் பகலும் அவருடைய வேதத்தில் தியானமாய் இருப்பான்.",
      "englishText": "and on his law he meditates day and night.",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.3.L1",
      "verse": "3",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-3-1",
        "h-1-3-3",
        "h-1-3-4",
        "h-1-3-5",
        "h-1-3-6"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-3-1",
        "t-1-3-2",
        "t-1-3-3",
        "t-1-3-4"
      ],
      "tamilText": "அவன் நீரோடை ஓரமாக நடப்பட்டு,",
      "englishText": "He is like a tree planted by streams of water",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.3.L2",
      "verse": "3",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-3-8",
        "h-1-3-9",
        "h-1-3-10"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-3-5",
        "t-1-3-6",
        "t-1-3-7",
        "t-1-3-8",
        "t-1-3-9"
      ],
      "tamilText": "தன்னுடைய காலத்தில் தன்னுடைய கனியைத் தந்து,",
      "englishText": "that yields its fruit in its season,",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.3.L3",
      "verse": "3",
      "lineIndex": 3,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-3-1",
        "h-1-3-2",
        "h-1-3-11",
        "h-1-3-12",
        "h-1-3-13"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-3-10",
        "t-1-3-11",
        "t-1-3-12",
        "t-1-3-13",
        "t-1-3-14"
      ],
      "tamilText": "இலை உதிராமல் இருக்கிற மரத்தைப்போல இருப்பான்.",
      "englishText": "and its leaf does not wither.",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.3.L4",
      "verse": "3",
      "lineIndex": 4,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-3-14",
        "h-1-3-15",
        "h-1-3-16",
        "h-1-3-17"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-3-15",
        "t-1-3-16",
        "t-1-3-17"
      ],
      "tamilText": "அவன் செய்வதெல்லாம் வாய்க்கும்.",
      "englishText": "In all that he does, he prospers.",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.4.L1",
      "verse": "4",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-4-1",
        "h-1-4-2",
        "h-1-4-3"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-4-1",
        "t-1-4-2"
      ],
      "tamilText": "துன்மார்க்கர்களோ அப்படியில்லாமல்,",
      "englishText": "The wicked are not so,",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.4.L2",
      "verse": "4",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-4-6",
        "h-1-4-7",
        "h-1-4-8",
        "h-1-4-9"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-4-3",
        "t-1-4-4",
        "t-1-4-5",
        "t-1-4-6",
        "t-1-4-7"
      ],
      "tamilText": "காற்றுப் பறக்கடிக்கும் பதரைப் போல் இருக்கிறார்கள்.",
      "englishText": "but are like chaff that the wind drives away.",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.5.L1",
      "verse": "5",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-5-1",
        "h-1-5-2",
        "h-1-5-5",
        "h-1-5-6"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-5-1",
        "t-1-5-2",
        "t-1-5-3"
      ],
      "tamilText": "ஆகையால் துன்மார்க்கர்கள் நியாயத்தீர்ப்பிலும்,",
      "englishText": "Therefore the wicked will not stand in the judgment,",
      "status": "not-started",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.5.L2",
      "verse": "5",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-5-3",
        "h-1-5-4",
        "h-1-5-7",
        "h-1-5-8",
        "h-1-5-9"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-5-4",
        "t-1-5-5",
        "t-1-5-6",
        "t-1-5-7"
      ],
      "tamilText": "பாவிகள் நீதிமான்களின் சபையிலும் நிலைநிற்பதில்லை.",
      "englishText": "nor sinners in the congregation of the righteous;",
      "status": "not-started",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.6.L1",
      "verse": "6",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-6-2",
        "h-1-6-4"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-6-1",
        "t-1-6-2",
        "t-1-6-3",
        "t-1-6-4"
      ],
      "tamilText": "யெகோவா நீதிமான்களின் வழியை அறிந்திருக்கிறார்;",
      "englishText": "for the Lord knows the way of the righteous,",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.1.6.L2",
      "verse": "6",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "hebrewTokenIds": [
        "h-1-6-6",
        "h-1-6-7",
        "h-1-6-8"
      ],
      "tamilTokenIds": [
        "t-1-6-5",
        "t-1-6-6",
        "t-1-6-7"
      ],
      "tamilText": "துன்மார்க்கர்களின் வழியோ அழியும்.",
      "englishText": "but the way of the wicked will perish.",
      "status": "approved",
      "source": "draft-scaffold",
      "revision": 1,
      "revisions": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-09T17:01:14.524Z"
    }
  ],
